        "type": "note",
        "x": 0.951456550103799,
        "y": 0.36002587922640844,
        "text": "Its appearance\nis like a dream\ncreature, strange\nand half formed.\n\nIn some ways \nmakes sense, \nin some ways \ncomplete chaos.\n\nAssociation \nwithout logic"
      },
      {
        "id": "9c3d8f2d-d296-48d4-9a40-c78a3977da12",
        "type": "note",
        "x": 0.8138924883534281,
